import json, hashlib
from pathlib import Path
G=Path(r'C:\Github\DecenniumDescent'); R=G/'DescentReviewChanges/ReviewBible'; A=G/'docs/audit/2026-10-08/full-game'; D=R/'data/playtest/spell_drafts'
read=lambda p:json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
rows=[s for s in read(D/'candidate_conjuration_rank2_3_sources.json')['spells'] if s['classAccess']['Mage']['rank']==3]
assert len(rows)==7
catalog=read(R/'data/public/spell_playtests/catalog.json'); by={s['id']:s for s in catalog['spells']}
assert all(not by[s['id']]['operational'] for s in rows)
p=D/'candidate_conjuration_rank3_sources.json'; assert not p.exists();p.write_text(json.dumps({'status':'SOURCE EVIDENCE ONLY — awaiting source conference; not operational','spells':rows},indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
intro='''# Seven rank-3 Conjuration identities — source conference

The eight rank-2 cards are promoted unchanged after your exact approval. Twelve promotion checks pass, including unchanged manuscript/source/access, Air Pet's two attacks as one commanded offensive action, raw source hashes and rendered text. Pipeline 42 checks / 89,040 class-level access boundaries / zero issues. Catalog: 152 reviewed operational identities, 696 unfinished, 261 unfinished with any actual class rank 0–3. All 848 IDs / 936 placements preserved. Whole-game closure, effect runtime, human balance, bestiary CR certification and final GitHub delivery remain open.

Please confer on these seven source packets and provide complete draftable decisions, ideally below 15,000 characters. I will return exact cards before promotion. All seven are rank 3 / base 5 RP: Dragoon class 13, Druid 5, Mage 5, Ranger 9, Shaman 7, Tinker 10, Wizard 5. All Action / V,S,F. Preserve their actual promises, and label every added scope/numeric/profile/frequency rule NEW.

1. Summon Earth Pet: source AC17 / HP30 / 1d10 bludgeoning plus knockdown; 60 ft / concentration 1 minute. Needs finite size/weight/walking Speed, ordinary senses/language, attack interface and reach, knockdown save/size eligibility and timing. Proposal one melee spell attack 5 ft using owner's actual spell attack, no ability damage mod; on hit STR save against spell DC or Prone. Knockdown is soft control, not whole-Action denial; Prone immunity and existing Falling rules apply. Don't add burrow, tremorsense, earthglide, stone defenses or scaling merely from name. One caster pet/global one owner Bonus Action command and one offensive companion action per numbered round; shared 60 ft command/perception and act-after-owner interface. Fixed source AC/HP/die remain; no imported monster block or automatic S scaling. Need whether Medium/Large knockdown cap or any size — choose explicit NEW rule.

2. Conjure Elemental Lance: source 30 ft line / 4d6 elemental damage / save half / instantaneous. Need line width/height/grid geometry, excluded caster, all creatures versus selected enemies, element set, save type, shared roll/halving/defenses. Suggest line 30x5x5 from caster, all creatures, DEX half; choose acid/cold/fire/lightning/thunder at cast, no object damage/ignition/persistent lance/equipment. Do not grant attack roll/crit or extra riders. Source leaves choice unspecified; use consistency with existing elemental families and record balance question, not quiet rank change.

3. Burst of Flamewind: source 'All enemies in 15 ft cone take 3d8 fire and are pushed back 5 ft.' Need explicit NEW save and success result or preserve automatic damage while save controls push — choose and explain source assumption. Enemy means creatures caster chooses as foes, not magic objective allegiance/hidden identity detection; ordinary perception requirement versus area hidden creatures needs explicit selection rule. Define cone geometry, shared damage roll, push direction/legal movement/obstacles/size/Brace/flight support/Prone not implied; push no ordinary OA. Clarify save controlling damage and push separately, damage immunity doesn't automatically stop displacement. Source selective enemies should not silently become all allies too.

4. Elemental Displacement: source range Self but effect 'Teleport self or ally 30 ft.' Preserve ally option with explicit new recipient selection radius (Touch/5 ft seems minimal), destination measured from that recipient at effect resolution, willing only. Caster must perceive recipient and legal empty destination, clear line of effect to both? State precisely; no transporting unwilling/grappled enemy by piggyback, held/worn lawful cargo conserved, external carried creatures excluded unless explicitly allowed. Need supported destination versus permissible midair with Falling; choose known viable square, ordinary magical blockers apply, Speed0 alone no bar, no movement cost/OA, no concentration, no residual portal. Partial geometry invalid = no movement, costs remain. Source Self preserved raw alongside authored functional range5 if touch alternative. No actual RP/rank/access/round reset by teleport.

5. Summon Spectral Steed: source explicitly 'Create a mount that can travel between planes', range60, concentration1min. Do not reduce it to mundane mount or ability only to use existing portals. The V6 world source supports actual spell-created interplanar passages (excerpt below). Need NEW finite mount profile, size/body mass/AC/HP/Speed/saves/senses, who can ride, mount/dismount cost because general mounted rules remain unreviewed, total real cargo pounds AND Load, no extra independent carried people/creatures unless explicitly allowed. Could give Large noncombat spectral mount, one willing Medium-or-smaller rider plus gear, ground Speed60, no flight/phase/attacks. Need rider command ownership/BA global companion budget, autonomous defense, support/Falling and mount loss dismount placement.
Actual planar crossing: define destination knowledge as specific known arrival site on another plane, what qualifies (personally visited or reliable description/map sufficient to identify site? no omniscient location oracle), whether one crossing per steed NEW cap, activation by owner BA command plus steed Action, occupied/warded/unknown arrival failure, preserved physical custody and exact elapsed clock. Must allow unwarded interplanar journey itself, not arbitrary requirement for existing portal or Director discretionary veto. State same-plane long-distance shortcut eligibility (source only between planes; no same-plane teleport built in), planar travel limits independent of summoning 60 ft, no channel/path attacks or opening for followers, no automatic return on dismissal. Rider isn't teleported back or deleted when mount expires. Concentration can continue across planes without invented tether; existing effects retain actual own range/plane rules. Does failed crossing consume one use? Avoid repeat probes locating hidden sites. No permanent steed matter or sale loot.

6. Resonance Conduit: source create a link allowing sharing RP between allies, range60, Core instantaneous. Needs finite duration/concentration choice explicitly NEW rather than leaving indefinite shared bank. Proposal two willing creatures with actual RP pools (caster may be one), selected within60 and perceivable/LoE. Conservative transfer only: donor voluntarily spends Action and chooses positive integer from current pool; atomic deduct/credit capped by recipient actual available capacity, no creation or discount/retune/refund/spellcasting-proc application. Define whether must agree immediately, max transfer per action, endpoint60ft each other and same plane/LoE maintenance versus suppression/break, one caster link, no relink by recast preserving unauthorized claims, resource cannot be spent twice/reserved as simultaneous spell payment. Do not give joint maxRP, casting rights or reset daily recovery ledgers/Dissonance/Refrain. Anti-copy transfers and interrupted action rules; effects may share only actual currentRP, not health/charges/materials/future recovery. Since sharing costs rather than creates RP, no arbitrary daily limit unless you justify explicit NEW decision. Need caster casts for5RP before effect so cannot use recipient future transfer to pay initial cast.

7. Faction Portal: source doorway to faction HQ requires positive reputation; Action60/Instantaneous, tags Planar,Faction. Preserve real door to HQ and source +1..+3 canonical reputation gate, not silently require membership, faction Seal invocation permission, existing portal or only same room. Need NEW exact HQ identification method/reception arrival site, cross-plane versus same-plane permission (Planar source tag supports either), endpoint range60 applies local entrance, meaningful doorway duration (1 round or1min? concentration?), dimensions/physical space/support and transit capacity. Specific known faction and known designated HQ receiving site avoids arbitrary hidden vault access/identity oracle; choose requirements not unlimited no-source Director discretion. Public/reliable known receiving site versus ever personally visited; if no declared receiving site allow a known ordinary HQ exterior entrance? Clarify so ordinary faction HQ without new magic infrastructure still works.
Need one-way/two-way, who may pass (caster/companions or any creature physically using it), crossing costs/time/legal destination/ordinary custody, projectiles/spells/LoE/sight/sound through portal or transport only, opportunity attack at entry versus teleport itself, occupancy/expiry atomic crossing (never cut bodies/delete carried goods), blocked/changed HQ/reputation between creation and use, one caster portal and suppression/expiry/dispelling with clocks. No reputation mutation/credential/granted permission, actual arrival guards/law/wards still apply. No return portal if one-way. Explicitly could bypass actual geographic route leg or accomplish arrival at Haven if HQ is there; don't invent blanket 'cannot bypass extraction' solely to protect minigame. It never auto-settles extraction/cargo ownership/contamination/taxes/claim identity/Opening clock. If actual reviewed planar blocker prohibits crossing, obey its written scope without inventing all future unreviewed spell effects now operational.

Shared: Action costs/class begin hooks/Dissonance/Refrain before counter window; no refund/previous concentration restore on failed/countered casts. SaveDC8+PB+actualcastingmod; attacksPB+mod, critical doubles actual dice only. Fixed concentration1min = tenth future caster regular-start, outside60seconds, preserve deadline across initiative/absence/death/planes. Source1round = first future caster start/outside6seconds; no resetting clocks via travel. New applications keep their own cleanup; spellcopies no free resource duplication/procs/copies of copies. Shared ordinary companion budget, actual weight/Load/cargo conservation, strongest flat bonuses, ordinary geometry/Falling/sourcequalified defenses apply. These are tabletop procedures; don't demand runtime simulator before authoring.

## Source evidence and actual access

'''
packet=intro+'```json\n'+json.dumps(rows,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\n```\n'
